# ADR-000 — Decision title

> **Summary:** The decision and the alternatives it replaces.
> **Epistemic:** The reasoning that makes this the chosen path.
> **Pragmatic:** What changes because of this decision.
> **Audience:** Agents · Oracles

---

## Context

The situation that demanded a decision. What was known, what was uncertain,
and what constraints were non-negotiable.

## Decision

The chosen option, stated as a claim. Not a description of what *is* — a
declaration of what *will be* because of this document.

## Alternatives considered

At least one rejected option and why it was inferior. A decision with no
rejected alternative is a decree, not a decision.

## Consequences

What becomes true, what becomes false, and what new work this creates or
remains undone.

## Status

`active` · `superseded` · `absorbed` (ADR-030). A decision is never deleted:
it is superseded or absorbed, and the previous version stays reachable.
